# FavoritesBooks 📚

## About the Project

FavoritesBooks is a simple iOS application developed using Swift and UIKit. The app displays a collection of 20 favorite books in a scrollable list.

Each book contains:
- Book title
- Author and genre
- Cover image
- Personal rating displayed with stars

## Features

- Displays 20 classic and contemporary literary works.
- Custom table view cells created using Storyboard.
- Book cover images stored in `Assets.xcassets`.
- Ratings displayed using filled and empty stars.
- Scrollable interface built with `UITableView`.

## Technologies Used

- Swift
- UIKit
- Xcode
- Storyboard
- Auto Layout
- UITableView
- UIStackView
- UIImageView
- UILabel

